THESE ROLES ALREADY EXIST IN THIS ROSTER AND ARE BEING KEPT — they passed review. Do NOT
propose them again, and do not propose a role whose remit overlaps one of them. Propose
only what is missing or what replaces a defect named above:
- contentstack-sdk-engineer — The Stack initialization in contentstack.ts needs live_preview configuration added and @contentstack/live-preview-utils declared as a dependency, which requires focused SDK-level work distinct from the React context wiring.
- contentstack-preview-react-engineer — The onEntryChange callback must be wired into the React context that distributes Contentstack content, not individual page components, which requires React-specific integration work separate from SDK configuration.
